  "title": "Peking Opera",
  "summary": "Peking opera is traditionally traced to 1790, when Anhui opera troupes came to Beijing for the Qianlong Emperor's 80th birthday. Its melodies and style then grew from the mixing of regional forms; it is regarded as fully formed by 1845 and was inscribed by UNESCO in 2010.",
